Next, the neural network architecture needs to be designed. This typically involves using a combination of convolutional and recurrent layers to extract features from the text and capture the sequential nature of language. Attention mechanisms can also be incorporated to focus on specific parts of the text that are important for classification. Regularization techniques such as dropout can be used to prevent overfitting of the model.
